{"branch":"신도림점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">신도림점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-f8b973f8f004e359.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"신도림점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-f8b973f8f004e359.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>서울 구로구 신도림로 20 해동빌딩 402호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 1호선</span><span>구로역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 2호선</span><span>도림천역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>대림3차아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>대림1.2차아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>대림5차아파트702동</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>대림5차아파트702동</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>미성아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>기업은행구로중앙지점</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>신도림미성아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>월드아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>구로공구상가/기업은행구로중앙지점</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>대림5차아파트.신도림주민센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">11</span><span>대림5차아파트.신도림주민센터</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>구로09</span><span>양천04</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>5